.** (Optional baselines Cortez 2022 and Yu 2022 are not listed as compared unless run on at least one cell.) Cells where regression RMSE/DM RMSE < 1 vs > 1 as a function of spillover share s, mechanism, d, p; the rule \"regression beats DM below a threshold\" stated with the *estimated* spillover share (from the same regression) and with the *oracle* share. Tiered comparison: Tier G (DM, HT/Hájek generic, cluster DM, C\n+**C4 — Where regression wins, where DM or HT wins (the regime map; headline).** (Optional baselines Cortez 2022 and Yu 2022 are not listed as compared unless run on at least one cell. The one-shot K-step diffusion regression with ρ fitted, `or_fit` for (e), is reported under its own name as the oracle-form floor, never as message passing.) Cells where regression RMSE/DM RMSE < 1 vs > 1 as a function of spillover share s, mechanism, d, p; the rule \"regression beats DM below a threshold\" state\n\nShell cwd was reset to /hutian/repo\n```", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "666e775c-b1d9-56bf-8044-3f893bb7b3c5", "at": 1795639196.3947163, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 27270, "layer": "worker", "category": "message", "kind": "session.session/request_permission", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "979791ecf4b536255b9032001a968626", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "message", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "session/request_permission"}, {"id": "68497369-e8b2-516a-94d4-862ec7c9f51b", "at": 1795639196.3993564, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 27271, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "role": "venue-repo", "actor": "venue-repo", "execution_id": "979791ecf4b536255b9032001a968626", "trust": "agent-reported", "outcome": null, "label": "usage", "repository": null, "flags": [], "causes": [], "summary": "context usage"}, {"id": "340fdade-4e80-5bb1-a5be-b61c49d262e0", "at": 1795639196.4050345, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequen